Current Dev Position: YP 2.6 M1 is accepting patches.

Next Deadline: YP 2.6 M1 release is June 11, 2018


SWAT Team Rotation:

=B7         SWAT lead is currently: Paul

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Paul -> Tracy on June 1, 2018

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Tracy -> Amanda on June 8, 2018

=B7         https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Tea=
m


Key Status/Updates:

=B7         2.4.3 is in QA

=B7         2.3.4 and 2.2.4 are also both queued ready for QA after 2.4.3.

=B7         Khem has been doing great work in heading off gcc 8.x issues an=
d several patches have merged in this area

=B7         We continue to struggle to get green builds for patch merging, =
there are a lot of patches being posted and we=92re doing the best we can t=
o get these tested, the good ones merged and feedback given on the problema=
tic ones.

=B7         We could do with getting a feel for who is using/interested in =
mips/powerpc support and which areas of those architectures they may be usi=
ng. We could do with rationalizing the test matrix and those are some of th=
e slowest emulated platforms we have, there are also questions about how lo=
ng support will be maintained in glibc/gcc.


Planned Releases for YP 2.6:

=B7         YP 2.6 M1 Build Target is June 11, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M1 Release Target is June 22, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 Build Target is July 16, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 Release Target is July 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Build Target is Aug. 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Release Target is Sept. 7, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Build Target is Oct. 1, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Release Target is Oct. 26, 2018


Planned upcoming dot releases:

=B7         YP 2.4.3 (Rocko) rc2 is built and in QA see https://wiki.yoctop=
roject.org/wiki/2.4_QA_Status it is 62% complete.

=B7         YP 2.3.4 (Pyro) rc1 is built and in QA see https://wiki.yoctopr=
oject.org/wiki/2.3_QA_Status it is at 7% complete.

=B7         YP 2.2.4 (Morty) rc1 is built and in QA see https://wiki.yoctop=
roject.org/wiki/2.2_QA_Status it hasn=92t started yet.


